{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","霜封冰界"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","邀请数名敌人与自身共同前往“永冬领域”，自身在“永冬领域”中获得大幅强化。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","蒂斯妮娅邀请3名敌方英雄及他们的召唤物与自身共同前往冻结万物的“永冬领域”，将其余所有未被邀请的角色冰封隔离在领域之外，持续12秒。优先选择累计造成伤害最高的敌方英雄作为邀请的目标。在挑战首领的模式中，蒂斯妮娅会邀请所有敌人进入“永冬领域”。\n释放终极技能时，蒂斯妮娅获得只能在“永冬领域”期间存在的抵御1400% + 250% ATK伤害的“寒冬护盾”。“寒冬护盾”持续期间，蒂斯妮娅得到极大的强化，免疫控制效果并提升60点急速和60%攻击力，且自身不会被击败。当蒂斯妮娅的“寒冬护盾”被打破或者所有被邀请者均被击败时，“永冬领域”将会提前结束。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":157,"end":164,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":152,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“寒冬护盾”抵御值提升至1800% + 250% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“寒冬护盾”抵御值提升至2200% + 250% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“寒冬护盾”抵御值提升至2600% + 250% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“寒冬护盾”抵御值提升至3000% + 250% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冰蚀涡旋"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤冰龙卷在场上移动，并对范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生成1个冰龙卷风，持续6秒。冰龙卷风会在场上不断移动，每0.5秒对所处格子上的敌人造成40% + 7% ATK伤害，对1格范围内的敌人仅造成20% + 3% ATK伤害。蒂斯妮娅释放终极技能后，不再主动释放本技能，而是在战场中立刻生成1个冰龙卷风和2个小型的冰龙卷风，持续到“寒冬护盾”结束。小型的冰龙卷风仅会每0.5秒对所处格子上的敌人造成20% + 3% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":73,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":174,"end":179,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":70,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":171,"end":183,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","冰龙卷风对所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至50% + 7% ATK，对1格范围内的敌人造成伤害提高至25% + 3% ATK。小型龙卷风所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至25% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":52,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":82,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","冰龙卷风对所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至60% + 7% ATK，对1格范围内的敌人造成伤害提高至30% + 3% ATK。小型龙卷风所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至30% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":52,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":82,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","冰龙卷风对所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至70% + 7% ATK，对1格范围内的敌人造成伤害提高至35% + 3% ATK。小型龙卷风所处格子上的敌人造成伤害提高至35% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":52,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":82,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","无尽冰锋"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射多枚冰刺，对命中的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在自身前方生成5支冰刺，随后发射出去，对命中的敌人造成140% + 20% ATK伤害。“寒冬护盾”持续期间，本技能的冷却时间降低至3秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身攻击力，拥有“寒冬护盾”的时间越长便会提升更多攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高7%。自身每拥有“寒冬护盾”2秒，会额外提高1%攻击力，最多叠加6次。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高10%。自身每拥有“寒冬护盾”2秒，会额外提高1.2%攻击力，最多叠加6次。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高12%。自身每拥有“寒冬护盾”2秒，会额外提高1.5%攻击力，最多叠加6次。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","凝滞之时"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次进入“永冬领域”时对敌人造成大量伤害，并且在“永冬领域”内只有蒂斯妮娅能够释放终极技能。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次进入“永冬领域”时还会对所有被邀请的敌人造成60% ATK伤害，并且在“永冬领域”内只有蒂斯妮娅能够释放终极技能。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至130% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至200% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“永冬领域”的严寒将使得整个战场的时间被凝固而停止流动。每场战斗中，蒂斯妮娅最多通过这种方式停止30秒的时间。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“永冬领域”内的敌人生命值低于一定比例时会立刻被消灭。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“寒冬护盾”持续期间，处于“永冬领域”内的敌人当前生命值低于蒂斯妮娅300%的攻击力，且生命值百分比低于15%时，会被永久冻结为冰雕而消灭。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","在“永冬领域”内，冰龙卷移动速度提升37.5%，伤害频率提升至每0.25秒造成一次伤害。另外领域内蒂斯妮娅自身获得60%减伤，且对敌方造成伤害时，附带目标当前生命值4%的魔法伤害，附加伤害不超过40% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":104,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","冰叠魔轮"]]}